        "en": [
          "The 20 ha park consists of lawn and flowers, pond and woods, greenhouses and a wash-house. Magnificent 120 m long greenhouses with flowers. The park has been listed in the supplementary inventory of Historic Monuments since 1944."
        ],
        "it": [
